						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 2
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Smite (12): With a Concentrate maneuver the nalfeshnee can surround himself with a halo of shimmering flames that explode 4 seconds later. Every creature within 4 yards of the nalfeshee rolls a Quick Contest of Will with the nalfeshee. If the victim fails, he becomes dazed (p. B428) for nalfeshnee’s margin of victory minutes. After that the subject is stunned (p. B420) and may roll vs. Will once per second to recover. The nalfeshnee can exclude any creatures from this effect, and he must wait 5 seconds before using this ability again. Using this ability costs 1 FP."
				}
			]
		}
